    <string name="profile_dynamic_colors_info_body">Imibala eguqukayo ifanisa i-app nemibala yesistimu yakho ye-Android: izinkinobho, ingemuva nokugqamisa kuthatha imibala esetshenziswa yi-Android, evela esithombeni sakho sangemuva noma ephalethini oyikhethe ezilungiselelweni ze-Android, futhi iyashintsha uma lezo zishintsha.</string>
