    <string name="profile_sign_out_title">Phuma ngemvume?</string>
    <string name="profile_sign_out_body">Konke kuvumelaniswe ne-akhawunti yakho (%1$s). Uma uphuma ngemvume, sisula ikhophi ekule divayisi. Amaqembu akho azobuya uma ungena ngemvume futhi.</string>
    <plurals name="profile_sign_out_pending_title">
        <item quantity="one">Ushintsho olungu-%d alukalayishwa</item>
        <item quantity="other">Izinguquko ezingu-%d azikalayishwa</item>
    </plurals>
    <string name="profile_sign_out_pending_body_offline">Awuxhunyiwe. Imininingwane yakho ihlala kule divayisi kuze kuqedwe ukuvumelanisa. Uma konke sekulayishiwe, sizokukhipha ngemvume bese sisula ikhophi yasendaweni.</string>
    <string name="profile_sign_out_pending_body">Imininingwane yakho ihlala kule divayisi kuze kuqedwe ukuvumelanisa. Uma konke sekulayishiwe, sizokukhipha ngemvume bese sisula ikhophi yasendaweni.</string>
