    <string name="profile_sign_out_now">Phuma ngemvume manje ulahlekelwe izinguquko</string>
    <string name="profile_sign_out_failed">Asikwazanga ukukukhipha ngemvume. Zama futhi.</string>
    <string name="profile_erase_title">Sula iphrofayela kule divayisi?</string>
    <string name="profile_erase_body">I-akhawunti yakho ayinakho ukungena ngemvume nge-Google noma nge-Apple. Uma uphuma ngemvume, sisula ikhophi ekule divayisi. Ukuze ubuye, udinga ikhodi yokubuyisela. Ngemuva kwezinsuku ezingu-30 ingasetshenziswa, i-akhawunti iyasuswa futhi ikhodi iyayeka ukusebenza.</string>
    <string name="profile_erase_body_no_code">Usebenzisa i-app ngaphandle kwe-akhawunti futhi awukavumelanisi, ngakho ayikho ikhodi yokubuyisela. Uma uhamba, iphrofayela yakho iyasuka unomphela.</string>
